    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-on-primary mt-10">
      What are the Current Hong Kong Property Stamp Duty (Scale 2 AVD) Rates?
    </h2>
    <p>
      Following the abolition of property cooling measures, all residential property transactions in Hong Kong are taxed under Scale 2 Ad Valorem Stamp Duty (AVD). Rates start at a flat HK$100 for properties valued up to HK$3 million, progressing in tiers up to 4.25% for properties exceeding HK$21,739,120.
    </p>
    <p>
      The removal of punitive property curbs marked a turning point for the Hong Kong real estate market. Previously, a foreign national purchasing a residential apartment faced up to 30% in combined Buyer's Stamp Duty and Ad Valorem taxes. Today, the tax landscape has reverted to a unified, transparent regime.
    </p>
    <p>
      Below are the official statutory Scale 2 Ad Valorem Stamp Duty (AVD) rate bands:
    </p>

    <!-- Scale 2 Rate Table -->
    <div class="my-6 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas dark:border-overlay-lighter dark:bg-surface">
